        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Mahatma Gandhi</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">1869 CE – 1948 CE</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Born</span><span class="info-stat-val">2 October 1869 in Porbandar, a coastal town on the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kathiawar">Kathiawar</a> Peninsula, into a Gujarati <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hinduism">Hindu</a> Modh Bania family; third son of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/karamchand-gandhi">Karamchand Gandhi</a>, dewan of Porbandar state, and Putlibai</span></div>
